			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Full Databricks AI stack\nThe **Databricks AI Agent** orchestrates the whole flow using only Databricks building blocks:\n\n- **Databricks Chat Model** – reasoning + responses\n- **Databricks Vector Store** (retrieve-as-tool) – RAG over Vector Search\n- **Embeddings Databricks** – embeds the agent's query\n- **Simple Memory** – conversation history\n\nThe agent reuses n8n's tools-agent execution, so it behaves like the built-in AI Agent.",
